(text
"DATA/FLASH supplies ADuM upstream only. Mainboard acquisition uses protected battery.\nJ602 is the pack 10kohm NTC (103AT-2); this signal and CHG_CE reach the isolated charger through J1202.\nThe primary CHARGE USB port, source-current gate, isolated supply and BQ25886 are all on the power daughterboard.\nNo charger SYS output connects to mainboard ACQ_INPUT. Physically unplug the electrode harness before charging."
